  "description": "A secondary DI container that runs alongside Microsoft's IServiceProvider at runtime.\n      Enables dynamic registration and removal of services after BuildServiceProvider() —\n      something Microsoft's standard DI does not support. Supports Singleton, Transient, Scoped,\n      keyed services, factory registration, cross-container resolution, cascade invalidation,\n      and a diagnostics API.",
